# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads: the same things .dockerignore keeps out of the image build, so the upload stays
# small and no secret leaves the machine. (Without this file gcloud would follow .gitignore, which does not list
# .experiments, 102 MB of stock photos.)
.git
.claude
.experiments
.shopify
docs
design-system
node_modules
.next
out
coverage
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
*.log
